%% PRD-018 — Edge state machine for a resolution edge (mention -> entity)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed : MentionObserved<br/>candidate found via MentionIndex

  Proposed --> Soft : confidence &ge; softThreshold<br/>no strong negatives
  Proposed --> Rejected : strong negative signal<br/>or operator reject
  Proposed --> [*] : no viable candidate<br/>(recorded as needsDisambiguation)

  Soft --> Soft : new evidence<br/>(append-only signals)
  Soft --> Hard : auto-promote<br/>confidence &ge; hardThreshold<br/>AND &ge; 2 independent signal families<br/>AND no negatives
  Soft --> Hard : operator promote<br/>PromotionRequested(user)
  Soft --> Rejected : operator reject
  Soft --> Superseded : registry rename / delete

  Hard --> Soft : demote<br/>new strong negative<br/>or operator demote
  Hard --> Superseded : registry rename / delete

  Rejected --> Soft : new corroborating evidence<br/>after rejection window

  note right of Soft
    Query-visible but NOT authoritative.
    Aggregations must opt-in with a threshold.
    Mention site carries softLinkTo: &lt;path&gt;.
  end note

  note right of Hard
    Canonical. Downstream aggregations use it by default.
    Mention site carries entityRef: &lt;path&gt;.
    Promotion snapshots signals for audit.
  end note

  note left of Rejected
    Append-only record; reappears in review
    only when new evidence crosses threshold.
  end note
